{"ref":"BDB, אֲבִיחַ֫יִל","hw":"אֲבִיחַ֫יִל","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אֲבִיחַ֫יִל</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m.</strong> & <strong>f. (</strong><em>my father is might</em>, Sab. <span dir=\"rtl\">אבחיל</span> Hal<sup>MA 234</sup><strong>)</strong>—prob. = <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲבִיהַיִל</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 11:18\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.11.18\">2 Ch 11:18</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲבִיהָ֑יִל</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 2:29\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.2.29\">1 Ch 2:29</a>—<br><strong>1.</strong>  a Levite <a data-ref=\"Numbers 3:35\" href=\"/Numbers.3.35\">Nu 3:35</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  a Gadite <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 5:14\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.5.14\">1 Ch 5:14</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  father of Esther <a data-ref=\"Esther 2:15\" href=\"/Esther.2.15\">Est 2:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Esther 9:29\" href=\"/Esther.9.29\">9:29</a>.<br><strong>4.</strong>  wife of Abishur <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 2:29\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.2.29\">1 Ch 2:29</a>.<br><strong>5.</strong>  wife of Rehoboam <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 11:18\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.11.18\">2 Ch 11:18</a>.","next":"BDB, אֲבִיטוּב","prev":"BDB, אֲבִיהוּד"}